// (1-4) and the event that connects it to a door it has never met (5-6). The
// split is honest at the size test: `Input.GetKeyDown(...)`, `Vector3.Distance(...)`,
// `FindFirstObjectByType(...)` and `AddListener(...)` are four different searches,
// and "open a door with a key" is none of them.
